:: Xerxes Response {"position":"1175,350","size":"100,100"}
The King: What shall we do with Queen Vashti, according to the law, because she did not obey my command?

[[Memucan's response]] 



:: Zethar {"position":"2075,350","size":"100,100"}
Hold your peace; for we all know it shall be the silent one.
[[The King]] 
